rases)\n- **Proper names with articles:** \"the Prince Prospero\", \"the Red Death\" (specific names that happen to include \"the\")\n\nLet me update my todo and move to Phase 2:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":375,"cache_read_input_tokens":56801,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":375,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a5027fd9-634a-4fbc-b2b1-f3c4543d4067","uuid":"37454ff3-9a5b-4913-9db4-c1b7e1ee296f"}
